WEBVTT

00:00.701 --> 00:03.108
PROBLÈMA: "A partir deth grafic dera foncion f(x),

00:03.108 --> 00:05.345
trapa f(-1)".

00:05.345 --> 00:07.502
Aguest grafic ei, en esséncia,

00:07.502 --> 00:09.082
era definicion dera nòsta foncion.

00:09.082 --> 00:12.281
Mos ditz: "Segon eth valor introdusit ena foncion,

00:12.281 --> 00:14.375
quin resultat obtiem?"

00:14.375 --> 00:15.502
Aciu mos demanen:

00:15.502 --> 00:21.500
"Quin resultat obtiem quan x = -1?"

00:21.500 --> 00:24.126
x = -1 ei acitau.

00:24.126 --> 00:25.970
x = -1.

00:25.970 --> 00:29.928
E eth grafic dera nòsta foncion ei en 6

00:29.928 --> 00:32.671
quan x ei parièr a -1.

00:32.671 --> 00:36.815
Alavetz que podem díder que f(-1) = 6.

00:36.815 --> 00:38.078
Ac escrigui acitau.

00:38.078 --> 00:41.711
f(-1) = 6.
